cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use these data, cite the release you used (its release_id is in manifest.json) and the
  original sources listed in metadata/source_registry.csv.
type: dataset
title: "Proof & Policy: Alcohol Policy and Revenue Open Data"
version: 0.3.1
repository-code: "https://github.com/whiptronics/proof-and-policy-public"
url: "https://proofandpolicy.us"
authors:
  - family-names: Whipple
    given-names: Ethan
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  A reproducible, source-traceable dataset of U.S. state alcohol policy, population, apparent alcohol
  consumption, drinking behavior and public revenue, with the code that builds it. Research preview;
  no causal claims.
keywords:
  - alcohol policy
  - public finance
  - open data
  - reproducibility
